<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 10-JAN					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 10-JAN					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Drena has 50 mph winds and is in the Tasmanian Sea near 35s/170e, moving southeast at 20 mph. Drena will continue this track, weakening and becoming extratropical within 24 hours, and is only a threat to shipping.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS</p>
</text>
